WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:07.970
OTTO HIGHTOWER: Errors were made in the hours
following King Viserys’ death.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:21.970
ALICENT HIGHTOWER: The war will be fought,
many will die, and the victor will eventually

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:29.910
ascend the throne.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:01:10.190
RHAENYS TARGARYEN: There is no war so hateful
to the gods as a war between kin, and no war

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:17.679
so bloody as a war between dragons.

